<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sierra Leone</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Sierra Leone is a country on the coast of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/west-africa">West Africa</a>. The Carthaginian explorer <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hanno-the-navigator">Hanno the Navigator</a>'s voyage around 500 BCE may have reached as far as modern Sierra Leone or <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cameroon">Cameroon</a>. The interpretation of his surviving account is debated by scholars.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/sierra-leone.jpg" alt="Sierra Leone" width="320" height="214" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Zscout370 · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Sierra_Leone.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
